Additional geometries - display flag for non-editable catchments.

Disruptive change - for non-editable additional geometries (catchments) display flag is added, defaults to false.

Additional geometries will not be loaded immediately unless entry.display = true;

Simple chart - now supports min X value.

"chart": {
    "minX": 0
} - if needed x-axis will begin at zero.

Fix to isolines.

Isoline settings now displayed only when .edit  = true;
Included defaults for Here isoline endpoint.

dropdown_pills added to elements;

Now filter[in] supports multi select with values as pills;
Config inside in-filter: "dropdown_pills": true

