adding fill complete method for sparse epetra CRS that takes in range and domain maps

  void fillingIsCompleted(domain_map_t const & dmap,
			  range_map_t const & rmap){
    data_.FillComplete(dmap, rmap);
  }

In the context of finding better descriptive names for core containers (which I did, at least
for the time being), I also changed the enum class inside core_configDefs
to be WrappedPackageName so that we have:

enum class WrappedPackageName{
   Undefined,
   Eigen,
   Trilinos
};

moving forward with good improvements:
* filled in metafunction in ODE to check if an app or model or evaluation class provided to the ode
is admissible according to some constraints:

   // has to have scalar typedef
   // has to have state typedef
   // has to have space residual typedef
   // has residual method with 2 or 3 arguments

* fixed mutable members for ROM galerkin class

solvers: new method to lin solver interface "solveAllowMatOverwrite"

This allows one to explicitly call a linear solver solve
for the case when the matrix can be overwritten (e.g. Lapack)
